Package: strata
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, geant4 (>= @GEANT4_VERSION@), geant4 (<< @GEANT4_VERSION@.0)
Maintainer: Ovidio Peña Rodríguez <ovidio@bytesfall.com>
Description: Monte Carlo simulation of ion irradiation, on Geant4
 Strata simulates the irradiation of a multilayer target: the energy
 deposited along the track, ionizing and non-ionizing separately, the
 projected range and its straggling, the spectra of whatever leaves the
 target, and the dose in test volumes placed inside it.
 .
 The package carries the batch program, the shared library it is driven
 through, and a graphical front end for preparing a run and looking at
 the spectra it produces.
 .
 Geant4 @GEANT4_VERSION@ comes from its own package, from
 https://github.com/ovidiopr/geant4-installers, which also downloads the data
 files.
